# Every build file the repository carries for the source tree, relative to
# /usr.  updatebuild reads this and copies each from the share onto the
# machine -- the conversions of phase 6 live in the repository's tree, and
# without this list no machine ever sees them: the first ipnxbuild against
# a machine still holding only the tape's build files failed 84 times with
# mk: don't know how to make -- the call sites were switched to mk and the
# mkfiles they name had never left the Mac.
#
# Not every entry is a mkfile: cmd/apsend/apsend is the package's own shell
